# Build context for the bridge image.
#
# The repository root is 1.1 GB of game assets (_runtime_assets/) and the
# webxash subtree has its own node_modules. None of that belongs in this
# image, and shipping it as build context is slow and leaks assets into
# the build. Negate only what the bridge actually needs.
**
!tools/deploy/Dockerfile.bridge
!tools/deploy/bridge/package.json
!tools/port/tsp-rs/scripts/ts-udp-bridge.js
